WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.256
Watch and read: Ama asks: It is rainy today. Which sentence describes the weather?

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:10.575
The answer is: Rain is falling.. Describe what you can see or feel in the weather.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:16.101
Watch and read: Ama asks: Fill the missing preposition: “We meet blank Monday.”

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:21.473
The answer is: on. Use on for days, in for months and at for clock times.
